1
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:10,250
ARACHNE: There you are, just as strong as I imagined.

2
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:21,000
What I said was true, I am the best weaver, and the jealous goddess Athena was the beast who couldn’t stand it.

3
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:26,500
An Eternal Punishment for being the best.

4
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:38,750
Now, my weavings serve to catch prey, and your divine bones will decorate my lair nicely!